{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"cbr-p000769","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["cbr-p000769"],"persons":[{"id":"cbr-p000769","label":"高武侯鰓","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"高武侯鰓","mention_ids":["c-shiji-008-gaozu:m020-0375"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m020-0375","chapter_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:p020","quote":"高武侯鰓"}]}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-shiji-008-gaozu","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-008","chapter_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu","mention_count":1,"mention_ids":["c-shiji-008-gaozu:m020-0375"],"paragraph_ids":["c-shiji-008-gaozu:p020"],"passage_count":1}],"most_mentioned_source_ids":["s-shiji-008-gaozu"],"mention_count_policy":{"scope":"currently_annotated_mentions","identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m020-0375","start":375,"end":379,"surface":"高武侯鰓","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000769","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:p020","chapter_id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:p020","text":"當是時，趙別將司馬卬方欲渡河入關，沛公乃北攻平陰，絕河津。南，戰雒陽東，軍不利，還至陽城，收軍中馬騎，與南陽守齮戰犨東，破之。略南陽郡，南陽守齮走，保城守宛。沛公引兵過而西。張良諫曰：「沛公雖欲急入關，秦兵尚眾，距險。今不下宛，宛從後擊，彊秦在前，此危道也。」於是沛公乃夜引兵從他道還，更旗幟，黎明，圍宛城三匝。南陽守欲自剄。其舍人陳恢曰：「死未晚也。」乃踰城見沛公，曰：「臣聞足下約，先入咸陽者王之。今足下留守宛。宛，大郡之都也，連城數十，人民眾，積蓄多，吏人自以為降必死，故皆堅守乘城。今足下盡日止攻，士死傷者必多；引兵去宛，宛必隨足下後：足下前則失咸陽之約，後又有彊宛之患。為足下計，莫若約降，封其守，因使止守，引其甲卒與之西。諸城未下者，聞聲爭開門而待，足下通行無所累。」沛公曰：「善。」乃以宛守為殷侯，封陳恢千戶。引兵西，無不下者。至丹水，高武侯鰓、襄侯王陵降西陵。還攻胡陽，遇番君別將梅鋗，與皆，降析、酈。遣魏人甯昌使秦，使者未來。是時章邯已以軍降項羽於趙矣。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-008-gaozu:m020-